{"v":4,"catch":"在這款尋物遊戲中，你需要尋遍街頭巷尾，解救在大城市中迷路的猫咪。","desc":"五個不同的場景，每個場景中都有一百隻等待救助的猫咪，只有一個人能做到這一切（那個人就是你！）\n\n留心那些眼睛、尾巴和鼻子——猫咪很小，而且數量巨大 ^^\n\n遊戲特色：\n- 原聲音樂；\n- 5 個不同的場景；\n- 505 隻猫咪等你來尋找；\n- 5 隻擁有個人營救故事的特殊猫咪！\n- 遊戲旨在讓你輕鬆思考，享受休閒時光^^","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2024-08-29","genres":["益智","冒險","桌上遊戲","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7345deed7c7fabf1971eb4b374cdb3e3636bfe09686ae3cef0909d83c1f56ce4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/56151a7c98c6941b393d9fd1856f0cdd58772bc1166d90da283ed9da14fe87a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5d2249b7fc15eb1d1cb38747a1121e3324b90d4848ede7de17fd6fe820e82e95.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/16d9fc078619624aaa383350adabd8caef923748b4cd8695d966d849c71658f1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b3e506b7deb609a708e3527c21290dc9011f7963caa107b1a759f9cd0004d8b8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80ff4d8c24ee68b15c4363853503d878154f1a3948abb33b2d0c1a5e26667311.jpg"],"titleId":"010007701f400000","dlc":[]}